## Reviewer disagreed (not applied)
es-a #14. "inciso 6" and "apartados 1 o 6" are not the same unit. Korean line 64 is 제1、6항 (paragraph → apartado). Korean line 68 is 제6호 (item → inciso). The checker maps inciso to 호 and apartado to 항. Calling the 호 "apartado" left 제6호 unmatched (수사미해석). The distinction stays.
